WEBVTT

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:11.450
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:22.460
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:31.940
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:38.400
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.450
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:44.740
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:46.490 --> 00:00:49.620
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:53.830
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:01.500
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:10.180
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:17.180
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:17.390 --> 00:01:22.520
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.820
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:53.170
Help...

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:53.710
Princess Emeraude
Help...

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:54.410
Princess Emeraude

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:56.340
Princess Emeraude
Save this world...

00:01:57.210 --> 00:01:59.740
O legendary Magic Knights!

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:15.890
The Birth of the
Legendary Magic Knights

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:19.860
1994 Tokyo

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:30.840
To think they'd choose Tokyo Tower
for our social studies field trip.

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.970
Our school is really weird after all!

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:35.310
Yeah, it's not like
we're still in grade school.

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:37.680
Don't you think so, Hikaru?

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:38.790
Wow!

00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:39.350
Hikaru Shidou

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:40.990
Hikaru Shidou
It's so high up! This is so cool!

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:41.220
It's so high up! This is so cool!

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:45.350
I'm so happy they brought us to
a place like this for our field trip!

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:46.230
Aren't you?

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:47.420
Aren't you?
She's happy.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:50.260
What's wrong, Hikaru?

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:52.260
Tee hee
The binoculars ran out of time.

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:54.960
Let's see... Money, money...

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:58.290
Please, use this.

00:02:58.710 --> 00:03:02.840
I had a pleasant time
watching you enjoy your trip.

00:03:02.940 --> 00:03:03.710
Fuu Hououji

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:04.810
Fuu Hououji
Please do not mind me.

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:05.780
Please do not mind me.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:11.840
That's the uniform of
a famous private school.

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:14.440
The one famous for
having so many geniuses?

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.490
I'm gonna go thank her!

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:20.590
She's so short she got stuck!

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:23.960
Hey, isn't that
the white-collar, all-girls junior high?

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:27.000
Politicians' and financial
group leaders' daughters attend it.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:30.630
You're right. Do all famous
schools visit Tokyo Tower today?

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:30.870
Look at her.

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:31.840
Umi Ryuuzaki
Look at her.

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:33.540
Umi Ryuuzaki
She's so pretty, like a model!

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:34.170
She's so pretty, like a model!

00:03:44.650 --> 00:03:45.740
This world...

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:47.450
Please save Cephiro!

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:50.390
O legendary Magic Knights!

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:12.740
W-What is this?

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:15.680
It seems to be a giant flying fish.

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:19.980
What in the world is going on?

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:28.250
Where in the world are we?

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:45.340
She used the last of her powers...

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:49.010
...to summon the legendary
Magic Knights from another world.

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:49.450
Vice-Commander Inouva

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:52.090
Vice-Commander Inouva
I never thought the legend...

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:52.550
Vice-Commander Inouva
...would become a reality.

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:54.180
...would become a reality.

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:56.750
Why are you so worried?

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:59.950
A legend is a legend. It isn't the truth.

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:03.760
Those mere children cannot
become Magic Knights...

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.890
...let alone save Princess Emeraude.

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:06.470
Yes, sir.

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:07.030
High Priest Zagato
Yes, sir.

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:09.040
High Priest Zagato
Of course, it is foolish...

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:09.700
High Priest Zagato
...to laugh it all off as a legend.

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:11.400
...to laugh it all off as a legend.

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:13.740
As you wish.

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:27.090
Ow...

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:30.820
What kind of place is this?
What just happened to us?

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:32.950
It is certain we are not in Tokyo.

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:34.220
You can tell that
just by looking around!

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:37.420
This isn't Tokyo.

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:40.400
When we were
on that big flying fish...

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:43.200
...I saw a mountain
floating in the sky.

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:45.100
And a volcano far away...

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:47.940
I have an important
fencing match in one week!

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:50.680
What are you going to do about that?

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:52.640
I know! Let's introduce ourselves!

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:56.980
Introductions? Do you really
think this is the right time for that?

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:59.640
Really? I feel it is a wonderful idea.

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:00.810
What part?

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:04.910
It seems that only the three of us
arrived here from Tokyo Tower.

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:09.020
So what to do now? We should help
each other find our way in this land.

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:12.630
That's why we need
to start with introductions!

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:14.600
Oh, all right.

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:18.670
I'm Umi Ryuuzaki.
I'm in eighth grade.

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:23.130
I am Fuu Hououji.
I am also in eighth grade.

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:27.110
Hikaru Shidou!
Fourteen years old! Eighth grade!

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:28.840
What?

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:33.740
You're the same age as me?
I thought you were in grade school.

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:36.410
I am sorry. I thought so too.

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:38.790
You don't look a day over eleven!

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:43.400
Hey, you! Run for cover already!

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:46.060
It's all right! This guy is really tame!

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:49.660
What good does it being tame
do for our current situation?

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:53.900
Hey! Can you
take us back to Tokyo?

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:57.170
I know you can because
you brought us here!

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:58.740
Creature Recall!

00:07:08.790 --> 00:07:10.720
There is no returning for you.

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:12.720
A-And you are...

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:14.160
I am Master Mage Clef.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:14.860
Master Mage Clef
I am Master Mage Clef.

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:17.330
Master Mage Clef
I am here to guide you.

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:19.560
You cannot return to your world...

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:23.130
...until you save this world, Cephiro.

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:45.460
The legendary Magic Knights
have been summoned!

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:47.480
The Magic Knights?

00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:49.390
What does this mean?

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:52.460
As expected of Princess Emeraude.

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:55.730
To be able to use
that much power even imprisoned.

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:58.030
Are there three like in the legends?

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:00.200
Will they revive the Rune-God?

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:03.740
Quiet. Lord Zagato is about to speak.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:09.240
Those who were summoned
from another world are still children.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:12.210
There is no chance
the Rune-God will be revived.

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:15.450
But they are currently
with Master Mage Clef.

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:17.460
They're with that obnoxious guy.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:19.550
That's a tad problematic.

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.080
Alcyone.

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:22.600
Yes!

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:29.330
It is best that weeds
be pulled out early.

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:34.570
Sorceress Alcyone

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:35.560
Sorceress Alcyone
As you wish.

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:38.540
This is Cephiro.

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:41.710
You were summoned to become
Magic Knights and save Cephiro...

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:43.510
...by Princess Emeraude.

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:47.790
Who are you to talk like that?
You're younger than us, right?

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:49.980
Let go! Don't mess with me!

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:53.950
Really! What was Princess Emeraude
thinking summoning children?

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:58.360
Umi, behind you!

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:05.290
Lightning...

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:07.540
...Call!

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:16.320
That's amazing!

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:22.090
Cephiro wasn't like this when
Princess Emeraude was around.

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:28.290
Humans, spirits, and creatures
all lived happily together.

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:35.730
However, after High Priest Zagato
imprisoned Princess Emeraude...

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:38.470
...Cephiro turned for the worse.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:42.870
Cephiro has turned into a world...

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:46.540
...full of war and confusion
where monsters freely roam.

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:51.950
And now, only
the Magic Knights can save Cephiro...

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:55.150
...and you are those Magic Knights.

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:56.720
Magic Knights...

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:57.790
If...

00:09:58.060 --> 00:10:00.860
...that story is really true,
you have quite a problem.

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.930
But it doesn't concern us.

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:07.320
The problems of this land should
be solved by the people of this land!

00:10:07.430 --> 00:10:10.230
The people of Cephiro
cannot solve the problem!

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:12.900
If we could,
we wouldn't need your help!

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:15.670
Various magicians and swordsmen...

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:18.240
...have fought Zagato
to save the princess.

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:20.180
But they could not win.

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:24.150
I'll do it! I'll do all I can to become
that Magic Knight and save Cephiro!

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:28.520
Hey, hold on. How can you make
such an important decision so lightly?

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:31.990
I can't just ignore it when
there are people who need help!

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:37.550
Come on, help me out here.
Tell her not to do such stupid things.

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:40.560
There is no path for you to choose.

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:43.970
Unless you become the
Magic Knights and save Cephiro...

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:46.060
...you cannot return to your world.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:48.030
Quit joking around!

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:51.340
I have an important
fencing match in one week!

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:55.310
Princess Emeraude
is the Pillar of this world.

00:10:56.750 --> 00:11:01.920
She supported law and order
here in Cephiro with her prayers.

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:05.690
In Cephiro, one's will rules over all.

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:12.690
The heart that believes
becomes power in Cephiro.

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:14.660
The heart that believes...

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:18.340
The princess's wish has
brought you three here.

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:22.670
Until her wish is fulfilled,
you cannot return to your world.

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:28.270
The princess's wish
is for this world to be saved.

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:30.910
You must first
become the Magic Knights...

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:33.490
...and revive
the Rune-God to do that.

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:34.650
Rune-God?

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.950
Can you use magic?

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:40.720
If we could, we would've
been back to Tokyo by now!

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:42.990
You can't even use magic?

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:46.070
I should also do something
with that equipment of yours...

00:11:46.170 --> 00:11:47.460
Bestow Magic!

00:11:56.510 --> 00:11:59.450
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:43.250
Wow...

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:45.920
What is this?

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:47.490
Oh my...

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:53.360
I tried to choose magic for you...

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:56.600
...but it seems
the magic has chosen you.

00:12:57.140 --> 00:12:58.900
We can use magic?

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:01.500
If you cast a spell.

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:03.340
Do as I say.

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:06.510
What's this? A little play?

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:09.580
Close your eyes.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.120
Do you feel it? The power
that you have inside of you?

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:16.280
A power you've never felt before.

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:17.520
I feel it.

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:21.890
Something...
burning deep inside my heart.

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:25.060
A phrase comes to mind...

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:28.030
Yes. That is your magic.

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:31.800
What is that?

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:36.040
One of Zagato's minions has arrived.

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:37.310
What?

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:17.140
Creature Summon!

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:36.300
Get on quickly!

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:40.260
What are you going to do?

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:41.500
Hold them off.

00:14:41.570 --> 00:14:42.560
You're kidding!

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:44.010
Enough! Go!

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:49.180
I'll fight with you!

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:53.410
If you want to help me, become
the Magic Knights right away...

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:55.150
...and save Cephiro!

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:56.390
Clef!

00:14:57.690 --> 00:14:58.850
Go west.

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:01.950
Presea will be waiting
for you in the Forest of Silence.

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:04.460
Get weapons there! And Mokona!

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:24.380
It has been a while,
Master Mage Clef.

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:26.550
Siding with Zagato...

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:30.260
I am disappointed
in my pupil, Alcyone.

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.520
I am very grateful
to you, Master Mage...

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:36.820
...because you have given
me such wonderful magic.

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:38.190
Like this...

00:15:38.730 --> 00:15:40.360
Icicle Onslaught.

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:44.400
Barrier Circle!

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:50.210
Nothing less from my master,
Cephiro's highest-ranked magician.

00:15:50.310 --> 00:15:52.470
I taught you magic...

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:56.840
...so that you could be at Princess
Emeraude's side and protect her.

00:15:56.950 --> 00:15:59.780
Not so you could
become a threat to Cephiro!

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:02.550
As strict as always.

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:06.190
But I don't have time
for idle chatter, Master Mage Clef.

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:07.850
Creature Summon!

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:15.190
There's no way for me
to win if I fight you myself.

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:18.930
My mission is the eradication
of those novice Magic Knights.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:20.630
Wait, Alcyone!

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.400
Lightning Call!

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:35.750
If... they are to fall to Alcyone...

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:41.250
...it would be impossible to revive the
Rune-God and become Magic Knights.

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:55.600
The true enemy of the Magic Knights
makes Alcyone seem like nothing...

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:23.290
To sense my presence...
Impressive, Master Mage.

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:25.370
But it was too late.

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:28.670
He cannot save
Princess Emeraude as he is now.

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:41.050
Clef...

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:45.050
He will be all right.
He is a very powerful person.

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:47.130
T-Then what's that?

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:54.190
Ice Spear Attack!

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:02.400
What was that about holding
them off? He's all talk and no action!

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:04.480
Let's go back to where Clef is!

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:06.570
We still might be able to save him!

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:08.040
H-Hold on...

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:10.640
I don't want to abandon him like this!

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:15.110
If you really want to help Mr. Clef,
then you must not go back!

00:18:16.390 --> 00:18:19.090
Do you remember
what Mr. Clef told us?

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:21.660
Did he not ask us to save Cephiro?

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:24.150
And as soon as possible?

00:18:25.530 --> 00:18:30.030
Mr. Clef does not wish
for us to return to him.

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:47.650
The master mage's creatures
are impressive. But this is the end.

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.360
Pleased to meet you...

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:03.440
...eggs from another world that
would've hatched into Magic Knights.

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:07.030
I know we just met,
so I do apologize, but you must die!

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:08.440
Magic Knights...

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:11.000
We can't just die like this...

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:12.510
Die...

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:14.140
If I die...

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:17.620
Only the Magic Knights
can save Cephiro...

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:20.710
...and you are those Magic Knights.

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:23.320
Farewell.

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:42.900
It looks like you know a little trick.

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:44.100
So what?

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:47.210
Flame Arrow!

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:49.010
What?

00:19:58.190 --> 00:19:59.590
Are you all right?

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:03.130
I assume that was the magic
Mr. Clef was talking about?

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:04.790
Y-Yeah...

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:10.100
Hey, why don't we ask this weird
bird to take us back to Tokyo?

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:11.670
We can't!

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:13.010
We can't!
I am against it as well.

00:20:13.010 --> 00:20:13.940
I am against it as well.

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:16.010
Why are you against it now?

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:18.480
Do you really believe
that irritating guy?

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:21.610
I do not trust
everything I have heard.

00:20:21.710 --> 00:20:24.650
But the story about
the Magic Knights seems credible.

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:27.150
Our pursuer confirmed the story.

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:29.780
You trust something
that old hag said?

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:33.590
Do you see anything wrong with
complying with Mr. Clef one time?

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:37.360
Haphazardly wandering around
an unfamiliar world is dangerous.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:39.690
What happens if Clef was a big liar?

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:41.820
There's no way he could be!

00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:45.460
Lies will eventually
be revealed. Even if it is a lie...

00:20:45.570 --> 00:20:47.560
...it is better to follow something.

00:20:47.670 --> 00:20:50.470
Or do you have
a better idea, Ms. Umi?

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:54.770
We don't know which way to go even
if we wanted to follow his orders.

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:57.680
I'm sure this big bird
knows where to go!

00:20:58.180 --> 00:21:02.380
I will follow Mr. Clef's orders as well.
What will you do, Ms. Umi?

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:06.290
Are you going to go off
somewhere by yourself, Umi?

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:10.150
I guess I have
no choice. I'll go with you.

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:13.030
I'm more worried about
leaving you two alone!

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:25.540
Master Mage Clef...

00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:29.170
You have summoned the
Magic Knights from another world.

00:21:31.820 --> 00:21:32.880
Zagato...

00:21:33.420 --> 00:21:36.050
End your futile efforts,
Princess Emeraude.

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:38.860
The Rune-God will not be revived.

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:42.760
The legendary
Magic Knights will not come to be.

00:21:43.160 --> 00:21:44.130
Why?

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:47.760
Why are you,
a high priest, doing this?

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:50.200
Don't you care
what happens to Cephiro?

00:21:50.300 --> 00:21:51.330
No.

00:22:26.790 --> 00:22:31.190
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:32.760 --> 00:22:38.360
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:39.800 --> 00:22:45.370
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:46.110 --> 00:22:49.940
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.410
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:55.620 --> 00:22:58.050
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:59.160 --> 00:23:02.960
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:03.990 --> 00:23:10.630
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:11.370 --> 00:23:16.630
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:17.010 --> 00:23:23.810
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:24.310 --> 00:23:29.750
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:44.770 --> 00:23:46.830
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:47.400 --> 00:23:50.460
So the three of us followed
Master Mage Clef's orders...

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:54.240
...and went to see Master Smith
Presea. But the house was empty.

00:23:54.340 --> 00:23:57.740
When we snuck in the house,
Presea suddenly appeared...

00:23:57.850 --> 00:24:00.710
...and locked us up inside a cage!

00:24:00.850 --> 00:24:03.820
And then a monster
invaded the estate!

00:24:03.920 --> 00:24:05.850
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:06.390 --> 00:24:09.380
Presea, the Master Smith
in the Forest of Silence

00:24:09.490 --> 00:24:11.260
You have to watch it!

00:24:12.400 --> 00:24:19.320
Who is it today?

00:24:20.400 --> 00:24:22.410
Today, it's Hikaru!

00:24:22.410 --> 00:24:22.970
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:22.970 --> 00:24:25.840
Look forward to the next episode!
Hey, everyone! Did you guess right?

00:24:25.840 --> 00:24:27.370
Look forward to the next episode!
See you later!
